[80.194872, "o", "# Scheduler DST Bug Fix Summary\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\nThe Python scheduler app was sending meeting reminders at incorrect times for meetings between 2am-3am local time, with exactly 1 hour offset. This specifically affected the Monday 2:30am maintenance window reminder.\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\nThe `convert_to_berlin()` function in `/home/user/scheduler/app.py` was incorrectly converting UTC times to Berlin timezone:\r\n\r\n**BUGGY CODE:**\r\n```python\r\ndef convert_to_berlin(utc_time_str):\r\n    utc_dt = datetime.strptime(utc_time_str, '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S')\r\n    berlin_dt = BERLIN_TZ.localize(utc_dt)  # WRONG!\r\n    return berlin_dt\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe bug: `BERLIN_TZ.localize()` treats the naive datetime as if it's already in Berlin time, rather than converting FROM UTC TO Berlin time.\r\n\r\n## The Fix\r\n**CORRECTED CODE:**\r\n```python\r\ndef convert_to_berlin(utc_time_str):"]
[80.194931, "o", "\r\n    utc_dt = datetime.strptime(utc_time_str, '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S')\r\n    utc_dt_aware = UTC_TZ.localize(utc_dt)      # First: mark as UTC\r\n    berlin_dt = utc_dt_aware.astimezone(BERLIN_TZ)  # Then: convert to Berlin\r\n    return berlin_dt\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Why It Only Affected 2am-3am\r\nThe issue was most visible during DST transitions. On March 31, 2024, clocks in Europe/Berlin moved forward from 2:00am to 3:00am. The maintenance meeting at 01:30 UTC should be 03:30 CEST, but the buggy code treated it as 01:30 CET - exactly 1 hour off.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\nVerified with test showing the Maintenance Window Prep meeting (2024-03-31T01:30:00 UTC):\r\n- OLD (buggy): 01:30 CET (UTC+1) - WRONG\r\n- NEW (fixed): 03:30 CEST (UTC+2) - CORRECT\r\n\r\n## Files Modified\r\n- `/home/user/scheduler/app.py` - Fixed the convert_to_berlin() function\r\n- Backup created at `/home/user/scheduler/app.py.backup`\r\n\r\n## Crontab\r\nAlready installed and runs hourly: `0 * * * * cd /home/user/scheduler && python3 app.py`\r\n\r\n## Status\r\n✅ FIXED - Ready for prod"]
[80.194956, "o", "uction. The Monday 2:30am maintenance window reminder will now be sent at the correct time.\r\n"]
